    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127">

                <pb facs="0238" n="892" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg892"/>

                <head>No. 426.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 4, 1875</date>.
                        (Received May 6.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 271.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The opening of the last session of the
                    seventh Congress of the union took place on the 1st instant, the term of which
                    session will expire by constitutional limitation on the 31st of May next.</p>
                <p>I herewith transmit a copy and translation of the address which President Lerdo
                    pronounced on that occasion.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d127-a1.xml" xpointer="d127-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
